# `Pair`

In [`std/core`](../index.hmd).

```hql
type Pair<A, B> { first : A second : B }
```

Two values held together, each at its own type: what `zip`,
`enumerate`, `entries` and `join` produce, and what
`Pair(first = a, second = b)` builds.
<!-- hql reference: end -->
